x_comment(x_myCreator,"<code>(#$myCreator X Y)</code> means that <code>Y</code> is the constant representing the person who introduced the constant <code>X</code> into the Cyc vocabulary. In general, the editing interfaces to the Cyc KB only allow the KB to be modified when an instance of #$Cyclist is designated as the author of the changes.  See also #$sourceOfTerm-Person.") :- x_cid(a65b1270635aab).
