x_comment('x_Wax-HairRemoval',"#$Wax usually applied to the skin of the #$Legs and '#$Bikini area' in order to remove hair (#$RemovalFn #$Hair-Strand). The #$Wax is applied when warm, spread on strips of paper, and then pressed onto an area. After the #$Wax has hardened/dried, the strip is pulled off very quickly. This usually hurts and doing this to yourself can be difficult. If the procedure is done at home, it can be messy. For these reasons, most people go to salons to have this procedure done. People who do get waxed for hair removal purposes must feel/believe that the #$Convenience of not shaving for a longer period of time as well as the smoothness (no stubble) and appearance they will consequently have outweighs the pain and monetary cost of the procedure.") :- x_cid(a65b1270635ab7).
