x_comment(x_HypothesisLevelStrategyForPredAndArgsFn,"An expresion of the form (#$HypothesisLevelStrategyForPredAndArgsFn PRED SET-OF-ARGS) denotes the instance of #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy that is applied when the #$Predicate PRED holds among some set of instances of #$HypotheticalContext and which rewards the particular instances of #$HypotheticalContext that fill the argument positions picked out by the (#$SetOfTypeFn PositiveInteger) SET-OF-ARGS.  A #$ScoringSoftwareStrategy represents a manner of scoring some #$Thing.  Here, the scoring is based on #$Cyc being able to determine the holding of a relation among some group of #$HypotheticalContexts.  In particular, this is likely to represent some complex relation among entities that are associated with those instances of #$HypotheticalContext that is not uniformly specifiable relative to the content of the #$HypotheticalContexts (as is the case with #$SymmetricDisambiguationStrategyForBinaryPredFn).") :- x_cid(a65b1270635ad3).
