x_comment(x_candidateNCScoreForRuleWithThresholds,"A sentence of the form (#$candidateNCScoreForRuleWithThresholds RULE RATIO THRESHOLD1 THRESHOLD2) states that for the #$NounCompoundRule RULE, RATIO represents the represents the success ratio for some (implicit) evaluation of the rule (cf. #$datedCandidateNCTestHasResults).  In this case, THRESHOLD1 and THRESHOLD2 represent (respectively) the hit threshold required to count a candidate compound string or a candidate head or modifier string as  well-evinced in the search (i.e. as a \"success\").") :- x_cid(a65b1270635ad8).
